{"execute":{"doc":1,"cmd":{"Write":{"PasteMarkdown":{"text":"Product team weekly\n\nMeeting notes · Tuesday 10 February 2026 · 10:00–10:45 · Room 4 and online\n\n| Chair | Notes | Attendees | Apologies |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Ines Duarte | Theo Park | Ines, Theo, Maya, Rohan, Femi, Clara | Josh |\n\n# Agenda\n\n1. Release 4.2 status\n2. Customer feedback from the January survey\n3. Planning for the spring offsite\n\n# Discussion\n\n**Release 4.2.** Testing found two issues in the export flow; both are fixed and waiting for review. Release stays on track for Thursday.\n\n**Customer feedback.** 412 responses. Search and offline access are the most requested improvements; satisfaction is up four points on last quarter.\n\n**Spring offsite.** Two venues shortlisted. Budget agreed at £4,500 for two days.\n\n# Decisions\n\n- Ship release 4.2 on Thursday 12 February after the final review\n- Make offline access the headline goal for the next quarter\n\n# Actions\n\n| Action item | Owner | Due |\n|---|---|---|\n| Review the export fixes and approve the release | Maya | 11 Feb |\n| Share the survey summary with the wider team | Rohan | 13 Feb |\n| Draft an outline for offline access | Femi | 20 Feb |\n| Book the offsite venue | Clara | 17 Feb |\n\nNext meeting: Tuesday 17 February, 10:00, Room 4.\n"}}}}}
